          "items": [
            {
              "text": "8",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Wayesethi uHezekiya ku-Isaya: “Lihle izwi likaJehova olikhulumile. Waqhubeka wathi: Ngoba kuyoba khona ukuthula neqiniso ezinsukwini zami.",
          "type": "text",
